ng new  vaccinations  that's exactly what happened at baptist  health in miami they canceled all  appointments for their first  vaccinations  because their expected allocation did  not arrive this week  in san francisco officials say they're  going to run out of doses  today in new york city mayor bill de  blasio says they have the capacity  to vaccinate 300 000 people a week but  they're going to begin to run out of  doses today too  we've had to tell 23 000 new yorkers  who had an appointment this week that  they will not be able to get that  appointment  for lack of supply rivka press schwartz  was one of those who lost her  appointment  schwartz is a high school administrator  in the bronx it creates  anxiety and maybe even a little bit of a  sense of panic i don't quite understand  scheduling appointments for which you  didn't have doses  fair point listen regarding what the  mayor of detroit said about pfizer being  right up the road and having more  vaccines that they haven't sold to the  federal government so they could sell to  states like michigan  pfizer told cbs news they'd be more than  happy to do it but they need the federal  government  to give the approval to do so the biden  administration says next month they will  start shipping vaccines directly to  community pharmacies around the country  and that should make a big difference  anthony  it's been so frustrating david thank you
 

